  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Hitler gave this spy a medal.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-test/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.156,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "0105db839f11"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "So did Britain's king.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-test/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.333,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "0105db839f11"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In 1941, he begged the British to let him spy on Germany.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-test/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.211,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "e8e2ca8df808"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "They said no.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-test/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.991,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "e8e2ca8df808"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So he signed up with the Germans instead, and stayed in Lisbon.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-test/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.731,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "efe9ce4f798a"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "From there, he faked reports from London, using a tourist guide and cinema newsreels.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-test/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.127,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "efe9ce4f798a"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The Germans loved them.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-test/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.11,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3ca967801739"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So the British hired him after all.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-test/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.365,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3ca967801739"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "He invented twenty-seven fake agents.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-test/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.054,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3ca967801739"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Three days after D-Day, he told Berlin that Normandy was a trick.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-test/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.528,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "f2d6f5c3da3c"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Berlin believed him.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-test/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.999,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "f2d6f5c3da3c"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In July, Germany gave him the Iron Cross.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-test/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.292,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "1bdc4bfc7757"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In November, Britain made him an MBE.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-test/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.286,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "1bdc4bfc7757"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Both medals were for the same lies.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-test/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.044,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "1bdc4bfc7757"
    }
  ]
}
